OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785350946
OL,3,CBritish woman's body found in suitcase
OL,4,Cin Athens
OL,6,FThe body of a 38-year-old British
OL,7,Fwoman has been found inside a suitcase
OL,8,Fin Athens, according to Greek media
OL,9,Freports.
OL,11,FHer identity was confirmed after local
OL,12,Fauthorities sent her fingerprints
OL,13,Fthrough Interpol to law enforcement
OL,14,Fagencies.
OL,16,FUS authorities ultimately provided
OL,17,Finformation that led to her
OL,18,Fidentification, as it is believed she
OL,19,Farrived in Greece on June 29 after
OL,20,Fflying via Cyprus from the United
OL,21,FStates.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/3
