OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785350946
OL,3,CBritish woman's body found in suitcase
OL,4,Cin Athens
OL,6,FA spokesperson from the Foreign Office
OL,7,Fhas confirmed they are providing
OL,8,Fconsular support to the family of the
OL,9,Fwoman, who they have named as
OL,10,FElizabeth. They added they are in
OL,11,Fcontact with local authorities.
OL,13,F"Our thoughts are with Elizabeth's
OL,14,Ffamily during this difficult time,"
OL,15,Fthe spokesperson said.
