OL,3,CBritish woman's body found in suitcase
OL,4,Cin Athens
OL,6,FHer body was found in an uninhabited
OL,7,Fbuilding in the central Athens
OL,8,Fdistrict of Kypseli on July 18.
OL,10,FThe police investigation into the
OL,11,Fcircumstances of her death is ongoing.
